<article class="worlds-beyond wb-roll-card">
  <header><h3>{{label}}</h3><span class="wb-roll-mode">{{modeLabel}}</span></header>
  {{#if success}}<p class="wb-roll-success">Success · Defy Fate</p>{{/if}}
  {{{rollHTML}}}
  {{#if defense}}
    {{#if defense.parry}}
      {{#if defense.hasTarget}}<p>Against attack total {{defense.target}}.</p>{{/if}}
      {{#if defense.resolved}}
        {{#if defense.success}}
          <p class="wb-roll-success">Parried · negate non-magical effects. {{#if defense.overwhelmingForce}}Overwhelming Force keeps damage at half or more.{{else}}No damage.{{/if}}</p>
        {{else}}<p>Hit · Parry must beat the attack total. A tie fails.</p>{{/if}}
      {{else}}<p>Beat the attack total to negate its damage and non-magical effects. A tie fails.{{#if defense.overwhelmingForce}} Overwhelming Force keeps damage at half or more.{{/if}}</p>{{/if}}
      <p class="wb-roll-note">{{#if defense.reroll}}Original Parry: {{/if}}{{#if defense.spent}}1 reaction spent{{#if defense.combatId}} · Parry used for round {{defense.round}}{{/if}}.{{else}}Practice roll · no reaction or round use spent.{{/if}}{{#if defense.reroll}} Wonder spends no additional reaction or Parry use.{{/if}} Apply Health changes manually.</p>
      {{#unless defense.unlocked}}<p class="wb-roll-note">Parry normally requires DEX 21. Check your ability or manual correction.</p>{{/unless}}
      {{#unless defense.armed}}<p class="wb-roll-note">Parry normally requires a held weapon or shield. Check your equipment or manual correction.</p>{{/unless}}
    {{else}}
    {{#if defense.hasTarget}}<p>Against {{#if defense.area}}area save DC{{else}}attack total{{/if}} {{defense.target}}.</p>{{/if}}
    {{#if defense.resolved}}
      {{#if defense.success}}
        <p class="wb-roll-success">{{#if defense.area}}Saved · halve damage before Resistance and Armor Rating.{{else}}Dodged · no damage.{{/if}}</p>
      {{else}}
        <p>{{#if defense.area}}Failed save · full damage before Resistance and Armor Rating.{{else}}Hit · Dodge must beat the attack total.{{/if}}</p>
      {{/if}}
    {{else}}
      <p>{{#if defense.area}}Meet or beat the area save DC to halve damage before Resistance and Armor Rating.{{else}}Beat the attack total to avoid all damage. A tie fails.{{/if}}</p>
    {{/if}}
    <p class="wb-roll-note">{{#if defense.reroll}}Original Dodge: {{/if}}{{#if defense.spent}}1 reaction spent.{{else}}No reaction spent.{{/if}}{{#if defense.reroll}} Wonder spends no additional reaction.{{/if}} Apply Health changes manually.</p>
    {{#if defense.overriddenDisadvantage}}<p class="wb-roll-note">Heavy armor without 21 STR gives disadvantage; different dice were chosen.</p>{{/if}}
    {{/if}}
  {{/if}}
  {{#if note}}<p class="wb-roll-note">{{note}}</p>{{/if}}
</article>
